Package: alg-control
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Sarthak <sarthakrpc@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libgl1, libx11-6, libxrandr2, libxi6, libxcursor1, libxinerama1, libxxf86vm1, libwayland-client0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Fan and keyboard backlight control for the Acer ALG AL15G-53
 Fan speed, fan curves and RGB keyboard backlight control for the Acer ALG
 AL15G-53, a Clevo/Tongfang design that acer-wmi does not support.
 .
 Installs a small system service that owns the embedded controller, the
 "alg" command, the ALG Control panel in the applications menu, and a tray
 icon showing the live temperature that starts when you log in. Whatever you
 set is put back automatically at boot and after sleep, and nothing needs a
 password once it is installed.
 .
 Replaces the earlier Python version: installing this removes it and keeps
 your settings.
